e happened successfully it's  been those low priority those unexpected  attacks and going back to my point about  situational awareness if each individual  had a higher level of situational  awareness when those unexpected one-off  attackers attack the the actual audience  that was their present would have likely  had a role in preventing the attack from  happening at all we've been speaking  with Andrew Bustamante former covert CIA  officer and founder of the everyday  espionage training platform Andrew  really great having you on I appreciate  it my pleasure David thank you very much  for having me
 

